# The build context is uploaded to the remote builder on every deploy, and the
# Dockerfile only ever COPYs package.json, package-lock.json and the named .js
# files. Everything below is local-only and was making the context ~175MB —
# backups/ alone was 175MB of it — for no benefit.
data/
node_modules/
backups/
test.js
README.md
fly.toml
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
*.epub
*.pdf
